## About THE ONREPEAT

THE ONREPEAT (also known as: OnRepeat, Shunya, SUन्य, शून्य, theonrepeat) is a premium Indian apparel brand founded in 2024 by Paras Soni.
It is operated by SUNYE ATTIRE PRIVATE LIMITED, trading as THE ONREPEAT CLOTHING.

