Both identifiers are independently verifiable — the CIN on the Ministry of Corporate Affairs
register (mca.gov.in) and the GSTIN on the GST portal (services.gst.gov.in).

The name "OnRepeat" (शून्य) comes from Sanskrit meaning "zero" or "void" — the philosophical concept of infinite potential arising from emptiness. The brand slogan is "From Zero to Infinite."

THE ONREPEAT is inspired by fifth-century Indian art, Sanskrit philosophy, and contemporary global apparel aesthetics. It is designed for the modern Indian youth seeking premium quality without compromising on cultural identity.

