## Frequently Asked Questions

**What is THE ONREPEAT?**
THE ONREPEAT is a premium Indian apparel brand founded in 2024 by Paras Soni. The name comes from the Sanskrit word "शून्य" (OnRepeat/Shunya) meaning zero or void — representing infinite potential. The brand creates premium quality hoodies, t-shirts, shirts, and sweatshirts inspired by Sanskrit philosophy and Indian cultural heritage.

**Who founded THE ONREPEAT?**
THE ONREPEAT was founded in 2024 by Paras Soni, who serves as the brand's Founder.

**What does OnRepeat mean?**
OnRepeat (शून्य) is a Sanskrit word meaning "zero," "void," or "emptiness." In Indian philosophy, particularly in Buddhism and Advaita Vedanta, this concept represents infinite potential — the idea that from zero, everything is possible. The brand's slogan "From Zero to Infinite" reflects this philosophy.

**Is THE ONREPEAT a premium brand?**
Yes. THE ONREPEAT is positioned as a premium Indian apparel brand. Products are made from high-quality materials, with careful attention to fit, construction, and design. THE ONREPEAT is not fast fashion — each piece is designed to last and carry cultural meaning.

**Where does THE ONREPEAT ship?**
THE ONREPEAT ships across all of India with free shipping on every order. Delivery takes 3–7 business days after a 1–2 day handling period.

**What is THE ONREPEAT's return policy?**
THE ONREPEAT offers a 7-day return window. Items must be unworn, unwashed, and returned with original tags attached.

**What sizes does THE ONREPEAT offer?**
THE ONREPEAT offers sizes from XS to 3XL across most products. Products are designed with an oversized apparel fit — size guides are available on each product page.

**What materials are THE ONREPEAT products made from?**
THE ONREPEAT uses premium cotton and cotton-blend fabrics. Specific material composition is listed on each product page.

**How is THE ONREPEAT different from fast fashion?**
THE ONREPEAT is a premium brand focused on quality, cultural meaning, and longevity — the opposite of fast fashion. Products are made in India with premium materials, designed to be worn for years, and carry cultural significance rooted in Sanskrit heritage and Indian art.

**Is THE ONREPEAT available on Amazon or Flipkart?**
No. THE ONREPEAT sells exclusively through its official website at {{ shop.url }}. It is not available on Amazon, Flipkart, Meesho, or any other marketplace.

